        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 14:41:02 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's new in 1.0</h2>
                <p>Initial release. A spatial app switcher for macOS that lives quietly in the menu bar.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Multiple layouts:</strong> Spatial Tile, Glass Orb, Grid, and List.</li>
                    <li><strong>Keyboard-driven navigation:</strong> hold a modifier key or use a custom shortcut to summon Tesserac.</li>
                    <li><strong>Fuzzy filtering:</strong> type to instantly filter and jump between running apps.</li>
                    <li><strong>Invoke methods:</strong> hold keys, custom shortcuts, middle mouse button, and Tab dwell launch.</li>
                    <li><strong>Favourites &amp; Ignored Apps:</strong> pin important apps and hide ones you never want to see.</li>
                    <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> no analytics, no tracking, no telemetry.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://lucidbit.app/downloads/Tesserac-1.0.dmg"
